# PREVIO — Project Conventions

## Stack

- **Monorepo:** pnpm workspaces + Turborepo
- **Frontend:** `apps/web` (Next.js 15) → Vercel
- **API:** `apps/api` (Hono) → ECS / Docker locally
- **Auth:** Cognito (authentication) + PostgreSQL RBAC (authorization)
- **DB:** Drizzle ORM in `packages/db`

## Layout

```
apps/web, apps/api          → deployables
packages/calculation, db      → shared libraries
packages/contracts          → planned shared API schemas
apps/docs                   → planned Docusaurus site
docs/                       → project-context.md, architecture.md, deployment.md
infra/terraform/            → AWS (dev/stage/prod)
```

Promote logic to separate `apps/*-service` only when independent deploy/scaling is needed (see `docs/architecture.md`).

## RBAC — four roles

| ID | Display name |
|----|--------------|
| `super-admin` | Super Admin (PREVIO / Schuco) |
| `company-admin` | Company Admin |
| `super-user` | Super User (Sales Manager) |
| `user` | User (Sales Associate) |

Users may belong to multiple business units; edit rights are a subset.

## Demo users — single source of truth

Define demo users in `packages/db/src/demo-users.ts` only. Seed via `packages/db/src/seed.ts`.

- Client UI: import from `@schuco/db/demo-users` (never `@schuco/db` in client components — pulls Postgres)
- Server routes: may import from `@schuco/db`
- Do not duplicate user lists in dev-login, login form, or settings fixtures

## Local dev

```bash
docker compose up -d   # Postgres + API + migrate/seed
pnpm dev               # Web (API on :3001 via Docker)
```

Dev login uses seed emails when Cognito is not configured.

## Commits

Use conventional commits (`feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `refactor`, `test`).
